inal_title":"Who Am I This Time?","overview":"","popularity":0.8965,"poster_path":"/81KzQ4AGbDmO6NtzNIwlIC8VQHk.jpg","release_date":"1982-02-02","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.4,"vote_count":15,"credit_id":"52fe4be4c3a368484e19d933","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":212641,"title":"Enzo Avitabile Music Life","original_language":"en","original_title":"Enzo Avitabile Music Life","overview":"","popularity":1.5175,"poster_path":"/7oJyt5kmOamTaMH2tMWDE1Pg6iA.jpg","release_date":"2013-10-18","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":10.0,"vote_count":1,"credit_id":"52fe4db2c3a368484e1f790d","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/AckDhp2FYTD9AbhpDCk6HyrjNc8.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":244783,"title":"Siła muzyki","original_language":"en","original_title":"Song One","overview":"Fanny rzuca wszystko i wraca do domu, gdy dowiaduje się, że jej brat, Henry, uległ poważnemu wypadkowi i leży w śpiączce. Zaczyna odtwarzać jego życie, marzącego o karierze muzyka i odnajduje idola swego brata, wschodzącą gwiazdę muzyki Jamesa Forestera (Johnny Flynn). Kiedy James odwiedza Henry’ego w szpitalu, miedzy obojgiem nawiązuje się niecodzienna relacja, która skłania ich do głębokiego przeanalizowania siebie samych, w tym zapadającym w pamięć dramacie.","popularity":2.1284,"poster_path":"/a6dSJIEMxZFvQ7XJy4sf9fR0p7f.jpg","release_date":"2014-01-20","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.716,"vote_count":245,"credit_id":"52fe4ef7c3a36847f82b3f0b","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/u8qF3J9kWR41RFAnN4eBEvxn8uc.jpg","genre_ids":[18],"id":268536,"title":"A Master Builder","original_language":"en","original_title":"A Master Builder","overview":"","popularity":1.2997,"poster_path":"/8j8hI2QPnNH49oXB1dGyy8ivuTM.jpg","release_date":"2014-07-23","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.9,"vote_count":26,"credit_id":"536a5b99c3a368124100837c","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/eugEjTlfllNOJyySa77exfJtxO.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18,10402],"id":275601,"title":"Nigdy nie jest za późno","original_language":"en","original_title":"Ricki and the Flash","overview":"Supertrio Meryl Streep (trzykrotna laureatka Oscara), Jonathan Demme (Oscar za \"Milczenie owiec\", \"Filadelfia\", \"Rachel wychodzi za mąż\") i Diablo Cody (Oscar za scenariusz do filmu \"Juno\") przedstawia historię starzejącej się gwiazdy rocka (Meryl Streep ), która w młodości porzuciła rodzinę na rzecz show biznesu. Teraz wraca na łono rodziny, a właściwie próbuje pozbierać jej szczątki. Nie jest przy tym pokorna i cierpliwa, tak jak współczująca nie jest jej rozwiedziona córka (Mamie Gummer).","popularity":3.1356,"poster_path":"/gosuuhcEBbfQeTkkxGDugA8d0hz.jpg","release_date":"2015-07-10","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.778,"vote_count":746,"credit_id":"5397fdaf0e0a266db700c1d4","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[18],"id":277793,"title":"Roy Cohn/Jack Smith","original_language":"en","original_title":"Roy Cohn/Jack Smith","overview":"","popularity":0.5991,"poster_path":"/hA61sXAAP4ErvFyBAvyJs46CkB2.jpg","release_date":"1995-08-04","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":10.0,"vote_count":1,"credit_id":"53a53925c3a3687a34000c16","department":"Production","job":"Executive Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/3Jv5yabV4PyZHw8HETrNRsZbonU.jpg","genre_ids":[28,18],"id":83954,"title":"Fly Me","original_language":"en","original_title":"Fly Me","overview":"","popularity":1.8544,"poster_path":"/662l7btCuI4ly4ovLs6QJYlhhoD.jpg","release_date":"1973-03-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":4.857,"vote_count":7,"credit_id":"5451f09c0e0a262d46003ba4","department":"Crew","job":"Second Unit"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":1011748,"title":"Joe and Linda Flooded Out of Holy Cross","original_language":"en","original_title":"Joe and Linda Flooded Out of Holy Cross","overview":"","popularity":0.6104,"poster_path":"/cplJrjIC673q0PZiPOUogL75ocw.jpg","release_date":"2010-04-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":1,"credit_id":"630025edbf31f2007af670aa","department":"Camera","job":"Director of Photography"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":1011748,"title":"Joe and Linda Flooded Out of Holy Cross","original_language":"en","original_title":"Joe and Linda Flooded Out of Holy Cross","overview":"","popularity":0.6104,"poster_path":"/cplJrjIC673q0PZiPOUogL75ocw.jpg","release_date":"2010-04-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":1,"credit_id":"630026093af929007d8c2e64","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":1011748,"title":"Joe and Linda Flooded Out of Holy Cross","original_language":"en","original_title":"Joe and Linda Flooded Out of Holy Cross","overview":"","popularity":0.6104,"poster_path":"/cplJrjIC673q0PZiPOUogL75ocw.jpg","release_date":"2010-04-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.0,"vote_count":1,"credit_id":"62f5eda87a97ab007e102441","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mhZr6UcJi3Sqsrwq7FD181DQ6dh.jpg","genre_ids":[10770,35,18],"id":209802,"title":"Subway Stories","original_language":"en","original_title":"Subway Stories","overview":"","popularity":1.2588,"poster_path":"/pzy2cwGh3fssoxqaIJFWOnMax5x.jpg","release_date":"1997-07-24","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.647,"vote_count":17,"credit_id":"54c2be29925141315a0068da","department":"Directing","job":"Director"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[18],"id":326129,"title":"The Center","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Center","overview":"","popularity":0.6419,"poster_path":"/ukwDxWaLj0QkO8ZXk8J6NknnGFx.jpg","release_date":"2015-02-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":9.5,"vote_count":8,"credit_id":"54f04317925141795f00802e","department":"Production","job":"Executive Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/aHhR1Q5yOaCLCEDtyDXtiRNeyf6.jpg","genre_ids":[53,18,9648],"id":14462,"title":"Kandydat","original_language":"en","original_title":"The Manchurian Candidate","overview":"Bohaterem filmu jest tym razem weteran wojny w Zatoce Perskiej Ben Marco – doświadczony żołnierz, który wraz ze swoim oddziałem dał się jednak wciągnąć w zasadzkę. Życie zawdzięcza młodemu Raymondowi Shaw, który nie dość, że w pojedynkę pokonał wrogów, to jeszcze przez trzy dni prowadził żołnierzy przez pustynię aż do bezpiecznej bazy. Za ten czyn został wyróżniony Medalem Honoru.  Teraz Raymond Shaw jest znanym politykiem i kandydatem na urząd wiceprezydenta, a Marco odwiedza szkoły, opowiadając uczniom i swoich tragicznych przejściach i bohaterstwie dawnego towarzysza broni. Z czasem jednak w historii, którą Marco zdaje się pamiętać nad wyraz dobrze, pojawiają się luki. Bohatera dręczą koszmary, a wszystko wskazuje na to, że tragiczne wydarzenia z Iraku w rzeczywistości mogły wyglądać zupełnie inaczej...","popularity":4.9548,"poster_path":"/b7BXMiriLlbyWnVH1Mb8xADoJQ.jpg","release_date":"2004-07-30","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.494,"vote_count":1770,"credit_id":"5560ff779251417e5f0062ee","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/kPDmoP4BCFaELJVBog4nIV4CPge.jpg","genre_ids":[99,10402],"id":24128,"title":"Stop Making Sense","original_language":"en","original_title":"Stop Making Sense","overview":"","popularity":6.9666,"poster_path":"/utNpurUe1MMjEaHqvpkfxgfpSnV.jpg","release_date":"1984-10-19","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":8.3,"vote_count":377,"credit_id":"61b5e87dc995ee001aefb3ca","department":"Sound","job":"Sound Supervisor"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mhZr6UcJi3Sqsrwq7FD181DQ6dh.jpg","genre_ids":[10770,35,18],"id":209802,"title":"Subway Stories","original_language"